9","text":"不要把一件很伟大的事情做成了"},{"number":479,"start":"00:17:59","end":"00:18:00","text":"又付出"},{"number":480,"start":"00:18:00","end":"00:18:01","text":"到最后又不落好"},{"number":481,"start":"00:18:01","end":"00:18:03","text":"很容易如此啊"},{"number":482,"start":"00:18:03","end":"00:18:05","text":"咱都不说姐姐带弟弟了"},{"number":483,"start":"00:18:05","end":"00:18:06","text":"这样的家庭"},{"number":484,"start":"00:18:06","end":"00:18:09","text":"他哪怕爹妈带孩子多少"},{"number":485,"start":"00:18:09","end":"00:18:10","text":"这样的案例"},{"number":486,"start":"00:18:10","end":"00:18:12","text":"出力不讨好"},{"number":487,"start":"00:18:12","end":"00:18:13","text":"出力不讨好"},{"number":488,"start":"00:18:13","end":"00:18:14","text":"怪孩子吗"},{"number":489,"start":"00:18:14","end":"00:18:17","text":"你反省一下自己的动作是不是有问题"},{"number":490,"start":"00:18:17","end":"00:18:20","text":"到最后你又委屈我"},{"number":491,"start":"00:18:20","end":"00:18:20","text":"我为你"},{"number":492,"start":"00:18:20","end":"00:18:21","text":"我付出了这么多"},{"number":493,"start":"00:18:21","end":"00:18:24","text":"甚至我的青春都有一定的牺牲"},{"number":494,"start":"00:18:24","end":"00:18:24","text":"但你为什么"},{"number":495,"start":"00:18:24","end":"00:18:28","text":"后来你得看一下你当时具体怎么做的"},{"number":496,"start":"00:18:28","end":"00:18:29","text":"动作上"},{"number":497,"start":"00:18:29","end":"00:18:33","text":"我老干这种受力不讨好的感觉"},{"number":498,"start":"00:18:35","end":"00:18:37","text":"为了不出力不讨好"},{"number":499,"start":"00:18:37","end":"00:18:39","text":"所以我们现在需要调整一下动作"},{"number":500,"start":"00:18:39","end":"00:18:41","text":"调整动作的前提是调整心态"},{"number":501,"start":"00:18:41","end":"00:18:43","text":"好不好"},{"number":502,"start":"00:18:43","end":"00:18:48","text":"好的好的好的好好好"},{"number":503,"start":"00:18:48","end":"00:18:49","text":"感谢感谢嗯"},{"number":504,"start":"00:18:49","end":"00:18:51","text":"好嘞拜拜嗯"},{"number":505,"start":"00:18:51","end":"00:18:52","text":"好再见嗯"},{"number":506,"start":"00:18:52","end":"00:18:53","text":"客气再见"},{"number":507,"start":"00:18:53","end":"00:18:54","text"